(742, 'en', 'modal', 'modal.faq.a1', 'Register or log in to your account, click the \"+ ADD\" button and fill out the form. The record will go to moderation.', '2026-07-14 15:46:05'),
(743, 'en', 'modal', 'modal.faq.a2', 'Usually from a few hours to one day. The administrator reviews each record manually.', '2026-07-14 15:46:05'),
(744, 'en', 'modal', 'modal.faq.a3', 'Yes. Write to the administrator via the contact form specifying the name and what needs to be corrected.', '2026-07-14 15:46:05'),
(745, 'en', 'modal', 'modal.faq.a4', 'At this stage, the site is intended for confirmed deaths. A section for missing persons is planned.', '2026-07-14 15:46:05'),
(746, 'en', 'modal', 'modal.faq.a5', 'It\'s a sign of respect from site visitors — a way to honor the memory of each defender.', '2026-07-14 15:46:05'),
