(1594, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.prepared_by', 'Document prepared<br>by the Portal administration', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1595, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.intro', 'This guide explains step by step how to add a memorial record for a fallen defender through the public «Zoryana Pamyat» website. Anyone can add a record after signing in with a Google account — no separate password registration is required.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1596, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s1.title', 'Sign in to the site', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1597, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s1.p1', 'Without signing in, the record form is unavailable — this is the first requirement. Open the site зоряна-пам\'ять.укр and click the «Sign in» button in the top header.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1598, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s1.shot1_cap', 'The «Sign in» button in the site\'s top header — click on it.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1599, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s1.p2', 'A small sign-in window will open. Click «Continue with Google» and choose your account (a regular gmail.com address).', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1600, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s1.shot2_cap', 'Login window. Click \"Continue with Google\".', '2026-09-02 12:10:34'),
(1602, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s2.title', 'Open the add-record form', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1603, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s2.p1', 'After signing in, your profile will appear in the header, and the «Sign in» button will be replaced by «Add record». Click it to open the form.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1604, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s2.shot_cap', 'The site header after signing in — the user profile and the «Add record» button are visible.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1605, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s3.title', 'Fill in the form', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1606, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s3.p1', 'The «Add record» form will open. Only enter verified, accurate information — every record is moderated before publication.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1607, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s3.shot4_cap', 'The full «Add record» form — the table below explains every field.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1608, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s3.p2', 'The last name, first name, dates, and description fields are located in the upper part of the form:', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1609, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s3.shot5_cap', 'Close-up of the upper part of the form: last name, first name, middle name, photo, video, dates, place of death/burial, circumstances, and description.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1610, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s3.p3', 'Below — the map marker color and awards (both fields are optional):', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
