(1643, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s4.title', 'Set the location on the map', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1644, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s4.p1', 'This is the second field (besides last and first name) without which the record cannot be submitted. Scroll the form to the world map and click on the place of death or burial — a marker with coordinates will appear. If placed incorrectly, the marker can be dragged to the correct spot.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
