(1646, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s4.shot_cap', 'The map block with a marker placed — coordinates (lat/lng) are shown above the map. Click on the map = marker, the marker can be dragged.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1647, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s5.title', 'Submit for moderation', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1648, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s5.p1', 'Check the filled-in fields and click the «Submit for moderation» button at the bottom of the form.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1649, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s5.shot_cap', 'The «Submit for moderation» button at the bottom of the form.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1650, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.s5.moderation_note', 'the record does not appear on the map immediately after submission. It is first reviewed by an administrator or moderator — the star will appear on the site\'s map only after approval. Processing takes from 7 business days up to 30 days.', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1651, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.summary.title', 'Summary', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1652, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.summary.l1', '<strong>Last name</strong> and <strong>first name</strong> — required, letters only', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1653, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.summary.l2', '<strong>Location on the map</strong> — required, click on the world map', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1654, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.summary.l3', 'All other fields (middle name, photo, video, dates, description, color, awards) — optional', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
(1655, 'en', 'howto', 'howto.summary.l4', 'The record is published only after moderation — up to 30 business days', '2026-08-11 15:49:51'),
